# Project Rules & Guidelines
Please read and strictly adhere to `AGENTS.md` in the project root:
- Follow Clean Architecture (Presentation -> API Controllers -> Services -> Infra/DB).
- "Zero Hardcoding" Rule:
  - All status/stage enums from `src/constants/crm.ts`
  - All error codes and messages from `src/constants/errors.ts`
  - All financial numbers formatted in RM via `formatRM`
- Zero `any` in TypeScript.
- Strict Hallucination Guardrails & Source Citations for Tax RAG.
